<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Kushal Online Timeline Final</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fjalla+One&family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--c:#12CFFF;--bg:#E3F5FD;--t:#111827;--m:#5b6775}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{width:100%;overflow-x:hidden;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:var(--t)}
.wrap{max-width:66vw;margin:auto;padding:28px 38px}
.intro{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto 22px;text-align:center;font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--m)}
.card{position:relative;background:var(--bg);border-left:6px solid var(--c);border-radius:30px;padding:24px 24px 24px 44px;box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(18,44,70,.08);margin-bottom:18px}
.badge{position:absolute;left:-18px;top:12px;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:3px solid var(--c);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:700 21px Roboto;color:var(--c);z-index:5}
.photo{
float:right;
width:190px;
height:190px;
margin:0 6px 0 24px;
position:relative;
top:50%;
transform:translateY(calc(50% - 95px));
border:5px solid var(--c);
border-radius:26px;
object-fit:cover;
box-shadow:0 18px 36px rgba(0,0,0,.15)
}
.step{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#08B8EB;margin-bottom:8px}
h2{font:30px "Fjalla One",sans-serif;line-height:1;margin-bottom:14px}
.desc{font-size:21px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--m)}
.card:after{content:"";display:block;clear:both}
.cta{max-width:100%;max-width:1100px;;margin:12px auto;padding:30px;background:#12CFFF;border-radius:30px;text-align:center}
.cta h3{font:34px "Fjalla One",sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px}
.cta p{width:90%;max-width:950px;margin:0 auto 20px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.55}
.btn{display:block;max-width:380px;margin:auto;padding:18px 28px;background:#111827;color:#12CFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:768px){
.wrap{max-width:100%;padding:16px}
.intro{font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}
.card{padding:18px 16px 18px 34px}
.badge{left:-16px;top:10px;width:38px;height:38px;font-size:18px}
.photo{
width:100px;
height:100px;
margin:0 0 10px 16px;
top:auto;
transform:none;
border-radius:20px
}
.step{font-size:12px}
h2{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:10px}
.desc{font-size:16px;line-height:1.45}
.cta{width:calc(100% - 32px);max-width:none;margin:12px 16px;padding:24px}
.cta h3{font-size:20px}
.cta p{font-size:16px}
.btn{width:100%;padding:12px 24px;font-size:14px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<section class="wrap">
<p class="intro">Begin your personalized homeopathic treatment from the comfort of your home.</p>

<div class="card"><div class="badge">1</div>
<img class="photo" src="https://api.kushalonline.com/image/step1.jpg" alt="">
<div class="step">STEP 1</div>
<h2>Choose Your Plan</h2>
<p class="desc">Select a treatment plan, share your details and health concerns, then complete your secure online payment.</p>
</div>

<div class="card"><div class="badge">2</div>
<img class="photo" src="https://api.kushalonline.com/image/step2.jpg" alt="">
<div class="step">STEP 2</div>
<h2>Share Case Details</h2>
<p class="desc">Our doctors review your case, gather additional information if required and prepare your personalized prescription.</p>
</div>

<div class="card"><div class="badge">3</div>
<img class="photo" src="https://api.kushalonline.com/image/step3.jpg" alt="">
<div class="step">STEP 3</div>
<h2>Receive Medicines</h2>
<p class="desc">Medicines are delivered to your doorstep with clear dosage instructions and regular follow-up support.</p>
</div>

</section>
<section class="cta">
<h3>Start Online Treatment</h3>
<p>Choose the treatment plan that best suits your needs and begin your journey to better health.</p>
<a class="btn"
   href="https://kushalonline.com/start-online-treatment"
   target="_top"
   rel="noopener">
   EXPLORE TREATMENT PLANS
</a>
</section>
</body></html>
